<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-FENERBAHCE V JUVENTUS LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FENERBAHCE V JUVENTUS LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alen Boksic scored in the 21st minute to give Juventus of Italy a 1-0 lead over Fenerbahce of Turkey in a European Cup Champions' League Group C match on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
